{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BEFORE YOU BUY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are launching Collinwood in Early Access to offer you a way to support ongoing development and get involved in the creative process. We\u2019re offering the game at a small price for early supporters, with the chance to directly influence its future through your feedback. While the game is still in its early stages and may feel like a demo, your support helps us expand and improve Collinwood. Let\u2019s make it better together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249910/extras/collinwood_101.gif?t=1741888299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a vibrant and peaceful sandbox teeming with wildlife and nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your base expands as you progress, unlocking new game mechanics like cooking, farming, crafting, and hunting practice fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249910/extras/collinwood_102.gif?t=1741888299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dangerous animals inhabit parts of Collinwood, so it's best to keep your distance. (<i>For a more peaceful experience, ZEN mode offers exploration, camping, relaxation, music, and more, without any threats.)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249910?t=1741888299","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249910?t=1741888299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249910/80949139fdca98734c5ad35284e928c518554da1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741